    w3c-tokens:schema "https://designtokens.org/schemas/2025.10/format.json" ;
    w3c-tokens:description "[EXPERIMENTAL] Surface: contrasted context. A fully-provisioned high-contrast surface that inverts against the ambient theme via light-dark() (dark chip on light UI, light chip on dark UI). All 15 rest roles are bound to contrasted base tokens (background/text plus every foreground channel: ghost, input, navigation, checkbox, radio, switch). States derived at runtime." .

